- **Docs and metadata:** updated `REVIEW.md`, regenerated the review diffs, added `review/followup_150_delta.diff` (the actual unified diff of this follow-up's code changes), and updated `status.json` and `implementation_handoff.md`. `source_identity_note.md` was written by Codex, so I left its 100-epoch line as is and appended a note marking it superseded.

Architecture, `train.py`, the configs, losses, metrics, data rows/order/events/split and the prepared cache are unchanged. Preparation was not rerun. `model.py`, `data.py`, `metrics.py` and `paths.py` are still byte-identical to their originals.

