- **Full real audit:** rerun in 50 s and passed; its schedule section reads 150 / 15 / 0.2 / 1184 / 177600 / 35520.
- **Batch count:** the real DataLoader gives 1184 batches for both PairOut and CellOut (151508 rows, last batch 84). The configs therefore give 177600 planned updates and a 35520-update KL warmup (30 epochs).
